  "baslik_en": "Gadolinia pin with automatic ring subdivision",
  "aciklama_en": "Burnable region subdivision (v3 Y5): the SAME model as pwr_gd_tukenme, but the Gd pellet is a single material (UO2 2.0% + 8% Gd2O3) and is split into 5 EQUAL-VOLUME rings by Depletion > Region subdivision (tukenme.bolme). Five equal-volume rings give the same radii as the hand-written equal-area rings of the old example (0.18318 / 0.25905 / 0.31727 / 0.36636 / 0.4096 cm); every ring burns as its own material. Change the ring count and type (equal volume / equal thickness / thinning outward) to test convergence of k(t) and the Gd-157 curve (guide lesson 5.20). Power density 38 W/gHM; CECM with steps <= 1 MWd/kg. For teaching only; not a certification."
